# Cursor Rule: /goal Engine

When invoked as `/goal dev <task>`:
- Initialize `GOALS.md` with explicit stopping criteria and non-goals.
- Decompose task into `tasks.jsonl`.
- Work inside isolated git worktrees (`.worktrees/`).
- Loop iterations until acceptance tests, negative controls, and manifest hashes verify.
- Stage only explicit file paths (`git add <file>`). Commit with proof of goal completion.
